    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -760,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        700,
        640
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MediaForge Timeline — MiniMax H3 AV loop\n\n1. Pick your H3 models in the loaders: fl2va UNet (+ optional turbo LoRA), the Qwen3-VL text encoder (`type = minimax`), the **video** VAE and the **audio** VAE.\n2. Edit the segments in **⏱️ Edit Timeline** (drag the edges; H3 needs fps 24 and keeps lengths / overlaps on the 5+17n grid). Each segment has its own prompt.\n3. Queue. Start Loop runs once per segment: 🧬 Extend Latent carries the previous tail (video + audio) into the next segment, your sampler generates, ➕ Append Segment decodes and spills it to disk, 🧵 Assemble Segments writes one MP4.\n\nDefault plan: 3 × 107 frames, overlaps 22 / 39 → **260 frames**, 346,667 samples at 32 kHz. Batch 1 only. Seams are not guaranteed to be invisible.\n\n---\n1. 在載入器選好 H3 模型：fl2va UNet（可加 turbo LoRA）、Qwen3-VL text encoder（`type = minimax`）、**video** VAE 與 **audio** VAE。\n2. 在 **⏱️ Edit Timeline** 編輯分段（拖邊界；H3 需 fps 24，段長與重疊落在 5+17n 格點）；每段可有自己的 prompt。\n3. 執行。Start Loop 每段跑一次：Extend Latent 把上一段尾端（影像 + 音訊）續接進下一段，sampler 生成，Append Segment 解碼落盤，Assemble Segments 輸出 MP4。\n\n預設計畫：3 × 107 幀、重疊 22 / 39 → **260 幀**、32 kHz 共 346,667 samples。只支援 batch 1；不保證接縫無痕。"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## MediaForge Timeline — MiniMax H3 AV loop\n\n1. Pick your H3 models in the loaders: fl2va UNet (+ optional turbo LoRA), the Qwen3-VL text encoder (`type = minimax`), the **video** VAE and the **audio** VAE.\n2. Edit the segments in **⏱️ Edit Timeline** (drag the edges; H3 needs fps 24 and keeps lengths / overlaps on the 5+17n grid). Each segment has its own prompt.\n3. Queue. Start Loop runs once per segment: 🧬 Extend Latent carries the previous tail (video + audio) into the next segment, your sampler generates, ➕ Append Segment decodes and spills it to disk, 🧵 Assemble Segments writes one MP4.\n\nDefault plan: 3 × 107 frames, overlaps 22 / 39 → **260 frames**, 346,667 samples at 32 kHz. Batch 1 only. Seams are not guaranteed to be invisible.\n\n---\n1. 在載入器選好 H3 模型：fl2va UNet（可加 turbo LoRA）、Qwen3-VL text encoder（`type = minimax`）、**video** VAE 與 **audio** VAE。\n2. 在 **⏱️ Edit Timeline** 編輯分段（拖邊界；H3 需 fps 24，段長與重疊落在 5+17n 格點）；每段可有自己的 prompt。\n3. 執行。Start Loop 每段跑一次：Extend Latent 把上一段尾端（影像 + 音訊）續接進下一段，sampler 生成，Append Segment 解碼落盤，Assemble Segments 輸出 MP4。\n\n預設計畫：3 × 107 幀、重疊 22 / 39 → **260 幀**、32 kHz 共 346,667 samples。只支援 batch 1；不保證接縫無痕。"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
